PORTED CODE

Parts of the engine are ports of code by other authors, modified from their
originals.

qu3e, the physics engine        https://github.com/RandyGaul/qu3e
Copyright (c) 2014 Randy Gaul. zlib licensed. The zlib license requires that
altered versions are not misrepresented as the original software: the physics
engine here is a modified port, not qu3e itself.

Godot Engine, SpringBoneSimulator3D, the spring bone modifier; the character
collision recovery and contact classification
                                 https://github.com/godotengine/godot
Copyright (c) 2014-present Godot Engine contributors.
Copyright (c) 2007-2014 Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur. MIT licensed.

Kawaii Physics, AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSimulation, world motion damping
                                 https://github.com/pafuhana1213/KawaiiPhysics
Copyright (c) 2019-2026 pafuhana1213. MIT licensed.

JoltPhysics, active-edge baking in the collision importer and the contact
normal correction on inactive edges
                                 https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics
Copyright (c) 2021 Jorrit Rouwe. MIT licensed.

pyrite64, the collision importer and its mesh collider format
                                 https://github.com/HailToDodongo/pyrite64
Max Bebök, Kevin Reier. MIT licensed.
